# Process: pwd

## Metadata
- Description: Prints the name of the current working directory.
- Category: system
- Permissions: [basic] # Needs clarification on how CWD is managed.
- Author: 00reaper
- Version: 1.0.0

## Input
- None

## Output
- The absolute path of the current working directory.

